%% State — scan_jobs lifecycle
%% Canonical source. Regenerate exports with: npm run docs:diagrams
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: /api/run-scan step 1 (scans row)
    pending --> queued: ownership verified, scan_jobs enqueued
    queued --> running: worker claims via claim_scan_job()
    running --> completed: results written + score
    running --> failed: unhandled error (status only, no error_detail column)
    running --> stale: worker died mid-run
    stale --> queued: reset_stale_scan_jobs() (cron or admin "Recover")
    completed --> [*]
    failed --> queued: admin "Retry"
    completed --> completed: replay returns cached result

    note right of failed
        Observability gap: no error_detail,
        Sentry has no DSN in prod -> cause unknown
    end note
